            "startSeconds": 2858,
            "endSeconds": 2957,
            "summary": "A parent of two students at Orion expressed strong support for pursuing a parcel tax to fill the gap left by expiring COVID stimulus funds and to maintain mental health counselors, reading specialists, class aides, ESL support, and other programs."
          },
          {
            "name": "Brandon Matthews",
            "startSeconds": 2977,
            "endSeconds": 3002,
            "summary": "A homeowner and parent of a kindergartner voiced support for moving as quickly as possible toward a parcel tax to support schools."
          },
          {
            "name": "Elizabeth Flagle",
            "startSeconds": 3026,
            "endSeconds": 3109,
            "summary": "A parent and former campaign volunteer expressed support for the feasibility study, raised concerns about lessons learned from the failed Measure H campaign (including online trolling), and asked whether those lessons would be incorporated, while also noting a technical barrier for another parent trying to submit a speaker card."
